Ford Power-Up  

Weve been busy working to make your experience the best it can be.   

Recalls 22C15&#8239;and&#8239;22S45&#8239;  
We updated&#8239;software on your vehicle&#8239;to fix a potential concern with the accuracy of your vehicles Tire Pressure Monitoring System.&#8239; This completes Safety Compliance Recall 22C15&#8239;(USA)&#8239;or Safety Recall 22S45&#8239;(Canada).&#8239;   

Distance-to-Empty Improvement
We also updated the software on your truck to improve the accuracy of distance- to-empty measurement.   

There is nothing you need to do.&#8239;   

Ford Power-Up software updates like this let us handle recalls without the inconvenience of asking you to leave home. At Ford, we value your safety and we respect your time.
